# Infrastructure Plan

## Overview

This document outlines the planned infrastructure for the Enterprise Hybrid IT Lab. The environment is designed to simulate a small enterprise using on-premises and cloud-based technologies.

## Virtualization Platform

**Hypervisor:** VirtualBox

