| Hostname | Operating System    | Role                                          |
| -------- | ------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| DC01     | Windows Server 2019 | Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS), DNS |
| SRV01    | Windows Server 2019 | DHCP, File Server                             |

