## Infrastructure Dependencies

Active Directory provides centralized identity management for users and devices. Microsoft Entra ID synchronizes identities from the on-premises Active Directory environment. Microsoft 365 and Intune rely on Entra ID for authentication and device management. ServiceNow is used to manage incidents, requests, and user lifecycle processes throughout the environment.

